PokemonLeague_AgathasRoom_Text_Intro::
	.string "I am MELANCHOLIC.\n"
	.string "Third of the REVIEW BOARD!\p"
	.string "CRYSTAL's taken an interest in\n"
	.string "you, child.\p"
	.string "She'd sooner finish that INDEX\n"
	.string "than finish a conversation.\p"
	.string "Wanted it more than she wanted\n"
	.string "any of us.\p"
	.string "Mind you, she was usually right.\n"
	.string "That was the trouble.\p"
	.string "DAEMONS are for engaging, not for\n"
	.string "filing.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}! I'll show you how a real\n"
	.string "USER engages!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

